{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Intro music: \"Junkyard Love Podcast\"]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7840,
    "dDurationMs": 3225,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, well, Jess Soto, thank you so much for your time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11606,
    "dDurationMs": 2665,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I appreciate it. Welcome to the Junkyard Love Podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14872,
    "dDurationMs": 2864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for having me. I appreciate it.\nI'm happy to be here, Jacob."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18451,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah. You will certainly fit right in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21432,
    "dDurationMs": 3301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of the stuff that you talk about\nand that you explore in your book"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24793,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and on your podcast, on your YouTube channel,\non your Instagram."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28214,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everybody go check that out. The links are below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30375,
    "dDurationMs": 3581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you really cover a lot of the stuff\nthat we love talking about on the podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33976,
    "dDurationMs": 1901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm really excited to kind of like dive in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36237,
    "dDurationMs": 2421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we should start with a bio, though, Jess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38798,
    "dDurationMs": 3261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's kind of give people a bit of a rundown of who you are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42119,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that's an impossible question to answer.\nLike, who am I?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44860,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What have you been thinking about\nthese last few years on this journey?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48103,
    "dDurationMs": 3364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely. So this journey, I would say, began"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51928,
    "dDurationMs": 5627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in 2021, post-COVID, the journey of awakening,\nof discovering who I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58136,
    "dDurationMs": 4145,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that, I discovered my voice. I discovered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63242,
    "dDurationMs": 4364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more of myself, meaning that I stopped\noutsourcing my worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68046,
    "dDurationMs": 3423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to other people, seeking validation outside of self."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72009,
    "dDurationMs": 3223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this journey has really led me\nto discover more of who I am"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75292,
    "dDurationMs": 2382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to step into the wholeness and fullness of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78054,
    "dDurationMs": 2422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And part of that was writing my book,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80796,
    "dDurationMs": 4264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being vulnerable enough to tell my story\nand to share it with the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85320,
    "dDurationMs": 3382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and releasing the shame that I always held\naround my story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88722,
    "dDurationMs": 2242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and who I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92005,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it kind of began as a 15-year-old mom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95686,
    "dDurationMs": 6082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was 15 in the doctor's office and about to find out\nthat I'm expecting my baby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102548,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was terrified in that moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107650,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's where my journey began. And that was\nmy first initiation, being a mom at 15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112571,
    "dDurationMs": 3265,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. Right at the age when you're trying\nto develop your own identity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115896,
    "dDurationMs": 3565,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and figure out who you are,\nnow you're bringing a life into this world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119681,
    "dDurationMs": 3405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was life like for you\njust in the physical realm?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123126,
    "dDurationMs": 1663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, were you living at home still?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125149,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were you with the father of the child?\nWhat was going on there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128125,
    "dDurationMs": 4123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my childhood, I grew up raised by my grandmother,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132708,
    "dDurationMs": 3443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she was a very strict Catholic woman\nwhere I had zero freedom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136851,
    "dDurationMs": 4003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And up until the age of 14, so from age 3 to 14,\nI lived with her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140934,
    "dDurationMs": 3923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because my parents were both addicted\nto drugs and alcohol. My dad was in prison."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145077,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mom, she was looking for love.\nShe was just looking for love and acceptance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149320,
    "dDurationMs": 5663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she was escaping the drugs and alcohol,\nand she wasn't able to mother her children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157170,
    "dDurationMs": 5723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At age 14, I started running away from home\nbecause I was so sheltered. I wanted freedom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163513,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to experience life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166454,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After I started running away,\nmy grandmother was like, I can't do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171756,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She sent me back to my mother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174378,
    "dDurationMs": 5722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went from being locked in a cage\nto freedom overnight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180540,
    "dDurationMs": 5203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's when I started smoking weed,\ndrinking alcohol, having sex."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186823,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's when I met the father of my son."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190725,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I was living with my mom\nwhen I found out I was pregnant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195007,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he, the father of my son, already had a child."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198708,
    "dDurationMs": 3942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was 17, I was 15. He already had a child and..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204025,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I told him I was pregnant, he was just like,\nnope, you're on your own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208007,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, figure it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210708,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His family called me and said,\nwe'll give you money for an abortion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213929,
    "dDurationMs": 2501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're still in high school.\nYou have your whole life ahead of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217190,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was something in me,\nlike I knew I had a choice to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220111,
    "dDurationMs": 3982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was just like, no.\nLike, even that 15-year-old version of me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225193,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knew that I was going to bring my son into the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227495,
    "dDurationMs": 3842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was just like, no, I made my bed,\nnow I'm going to lie in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231597,
    "dDurationMs": 3822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm bringing this child into the world,\nwhatever that means, whatever that looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237080,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. And then, I mean, what did that look like?\nDid you have..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242585,
    "dDurationMs": 6182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, from ages 15 to, you know, the journey of,\nbecause you got married eventually, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248847,
    "dDurationMs": 1741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251008,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you having your child, you're 15 years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253869,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then up until the marriage,\nwhat happened in between there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256670,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was life like between there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258552,
    "dDurationMs": 4407,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was chaotic. So much chaos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262979,
    "dDurationMs": 3645,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have my baby. I'm still in high school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266784,
    "dDurationMs": 2864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still trying to graduate, you know,\npass my exams and all this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271351,
    "dDurationMs": 1101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My father gets out of prison."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273817,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the time, well, let me go back a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276498,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was living with my mom\nwhen I found out I was pregnant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280500,
    "dDurationMs": 2501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I didn't stay there because it was very toxic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283562,
    "dDurationMs": 4382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My sisters, I have four sisters,\nbut two of them were living with me at my mom's house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288444,
    "dDurationMs": 3581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they were extremely violent, like wanting\nto fight me while I was pregnant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292506,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "physically fight me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293706,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like one of my sisters wanted to stab me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296768,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was just too much chaos and drama."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300109,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my mom was smoking crack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302691,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, you know, I can't bring my child\ninto this house. Like it was just too much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307155,
    "dDurationMs": 3983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I started just couch surfing friends from high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311879,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of my friends took me in.\nShe was like, no, we're going to take you in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315782,
    "dDurationMs": 3323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her family took me in. So we shared a room.\nWe became sisters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320646,
    "dDurationMs": 2762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I felt, you know,\nshe was my best friend at that time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324509,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gave me a safe space to bring my son into the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329009,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, fast forward, my dad gets out of prison."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332230,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After my son is born, and he's like,\nnope, you're going to come move in with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335831,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wanted government checks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338891,
    "dDurationMs": 1601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He lived in a really rough neighborhood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340512,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were in the south side of Milwaukee,\nwhich there are a lot of gangs there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344413,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was really rough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346993,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I had to move in with my dad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351074,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I lived there for about three months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353135,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I did graduate high school,\nor I passed my exams that year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359496,
    "dDurationMs": 6122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My dad and I got into a physical fight\nbecause my sister got arrested."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365638,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My little sister got arrested and I was defending her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368399,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My dad was just like really talking bad about her\nbecause she got arrested."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373000,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm like, you act as if\nyou weren't the example of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377642,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he didn't like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380503,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he physically put his hands on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382683,
    "dDurationMs": 5582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After that, I was put into foster care with my son.\nAnd that was really rough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391146,
    "dDurationMs": 4049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I survived foster care.\nMy mom finally got custody back of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395215,
    "dDurationMs": 5654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I got into an abusive relationship\nwhere it was extremely toxic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400909,
    "dDurationMs": 3583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was an alcoholic. He was a mirror of my father."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404652,
    "dDurationMs": 7026,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was an alcoholic, using drugs in the streets,\njust used and abused me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412659,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I allowed it at that time\nbecause I didn't know my worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416462,
    "dDurationMs": 4844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was seeking some type of connection\nor love or acceptance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424288,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I stayed in that relationship for about a year and a half.\nIt ended really badly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428290,
    "dDurationMs": 5242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to put a two-year restraining order on him.\nHe tried to kill me a couple of times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434652,
    "dDurationMs": 7603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I was at 18.\nI met the father of my daughter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443935,
    "dDurationMs": 3861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got pregnant with my daughter when I was 21.\nI had her when I was 22."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448677,
    "dDurationMs": 3261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And her father, same thing. He was a felon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452628,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was hoping he was going to be nice. I was hoping\nthis was, you know what, I found this guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458291,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was so sweet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459792,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sorry, sorry, keep going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463514,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another echo of my dad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465735,
    "dDurationMs": 4723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was a felon in prison, and he had a mental illness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470498,
    "dDurationMs": 1781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had paranoid schizophrenia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473139,
    "dDurationMs": 4043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I found out about it because he told me,\nbut I didn't know what that meant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477782,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no idea, like, the extent of what that means."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482144,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I thought I was in love. We bought a house.\nI thought we're going to build this family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486866,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was 21, bought a house, working at a bank.\nI felt like I was getting my life together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491647,
    "dDurationMs": 6242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I got pregnant with my daughter,\nand he became extremely abusive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498529,
    "dDurationMs": 5181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He tried to kill me. He beat me one night.\nIt was Easter Sunday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503770,
    "dDurationMs": 1521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He beat the shit out of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506366,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Easter Sunday too, geez.\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509907,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was wild."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511368,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the next day I woke, well, I didn't really sleep,\nbut the next day when the sun came up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516469,
    "dDurationMs": 1621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was like, okay, I have a decision to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518610,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I needed to make a decision of like,\ndo I stay in this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521771,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and allow this to happen potentially again? Or..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526631,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I survive this?\nDo I escape this and choose myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531374,
    "dDurationMs": 4062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my daughter and our safety\nover this relationship or whatever this is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535496,
    "dDurationMs": 3242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because he was very capable of taking my life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539558,
    "dDurationMs": 2902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the next day I made the decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542480,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to the police and I went to the hospital"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545501,
    "dDurationMs": 3983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I just stood up for myself and I left\nthat relationship and I never looked back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550144,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My daughter is 18 now and she's never met this man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554791,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I met my first husband after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559013,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait, after that you met, wait,\nso there was another guy after this that you met?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564215,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm.\nAnd then what was he like? Was he a sweetheart?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566836,
    "dDurationMs": 4141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was a good guy.\nHe was a hero. He was a hero in the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570997,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good. Thank goodness for this guy. Shout out to him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575239,
    "dDurationMs": 3941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. Well, wow. I mean,\nwhat an incredible journey that you've been on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579460,
    "dDurationMs": 3982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, to come out on the other side,\nI applaud you for coming out on the other side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584182,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now wanting to help people and teach people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586483,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and share your story and have these vulnerabilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589105,
    "dDurationMs": 4763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, I'm looking forward to hearing\nstories of how you've interacted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593909,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with other women and how that's gone for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596671,
    "dDurationMs": 2982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But so firstly, before we continue going on,\nI just kind of want to stop right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600353,
    "dDurationMs": 4924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think is, like,\nwhy did you wake up that day after,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605617,
    "dDurationMs": 2582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, you know, he had that beating\nthe day after Easter Sunday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609160,
    "dDurationMs": 4204,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you wake up, what was it about that morning\nor that final, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613744,
    "dDurationMs": 3443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why was it that that time you went,\nyou know what, enough is enough?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617207,
    "dDurationMs": 2882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you became aware of your patterns.\nYou're like, I'm with this guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620209,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm doing this thing again. I got to protect myself.\nI got to protect my kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624152,
    "dDurationMs": 2282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was it?\nDo you think that was so different this time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627443,
    "dDurationMs": 3843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that time the fear was so intense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631326,
    "dDurationMs": 2222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I really thought he was going to kill me\nbecause he threatened it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633748,
    "dDurationMs": 1601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I knew he was capable of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636330,
    "dDurationMs": 3423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And being pregnant,\nI was four months pregnant with my daughter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640654,
    "dDurationMs": 3563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She really gave me the strength to, like,\nwe're not going to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645137,
    "dDurationMs": 4864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was scared and I didn't know\nwhat to do at that moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650922,
    "dDurationMs": 3282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I went to work. It was a Monday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654224,
    "dDurationMs": 5322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to work and I went straight into\nmy manager's office and I just told him everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659607,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I broke down. I'm like,\nthis is what happened to me last night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663528,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He gave me the courage to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667210,
    "dDurationMs": 4942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he's like, you need to go to the police.\nYou need to go to the hospital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672193,
    "dDurationMs": 4161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make sure the baby's okay.\nI will pay you for the day. Don't worry about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676415,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you need to go make sure you're good.\nYou're pregnant, you're carrying this baby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681117,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he really, like, talked me into,\nlike, you need to go take care of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684140,
    "dDurationMs": 2102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I didn't know what I was going to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686322,
    "dDurationMs": 3142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was really scared and just, like, confused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689504,
    "dDurationMs": 3763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this person that I love and I'm carrying his child\ncould do that, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693287,
    "dDurationMs": 4024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, I chose myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697611,
    "dDurationMs": 3643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that my son was also downstairs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701314,
    "dDurationMs": 2982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "listening to the whole thing,\nlike hearing his mom struggle for her life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704917,
    "dDurationMs": 4673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I feel like all of that was like,\nno, no, this ends here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710251,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was a repeated pattern\nbecause my mother was abused by my father."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714292,
    "dDurationMs": 3622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these were repeated behaviors that were inherited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718094,
    "dDurationMs": 5642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I needed to end it because I don't want\nmy daughter to end up in a relationship like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724476,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't want my son to abuse his partner.\nSo I needed to end that cycle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730221,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Wow. Powerfully said. Okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732643,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to dive into patterns and cycles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734704,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like becoming aware of our patterns\nand things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737505,
    "dDurationMs": 5564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before we go there, could you describe,\nwhy did you feel safe enough to go to your manager?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743189,
    "dDurationMs": 2501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, what was it about him?\nWhat was his presence like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746851,
    "dDurationMs": 2782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, not to pedestalize this specific guy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749673,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but clearly he was a safe enough person in your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752194,
    "dDurationMs": 1862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, a man had just beat you the night before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754576,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you felt safe enough to go\nto this other man the next day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757057,
    "dDurationMs": 741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was it about him?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759718,
    "dDurationMs": 3081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He just carried a presence. He was a caring person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762819,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had a wife, he had daughters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766520,
    "dDurationMs": 6242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he was just a kind person and a really good\nmanager and provided that safety."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773602,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I felt comfortable going to him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776923,
    "dDurationMs": 2923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was grateful that he was my manager\nbecause the previous one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779926,
    "dDurationMs": 3264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably I wouldn't have felt\nthat safety or comfort with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783430,
    "dDurationMs": 3464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he really was a safe person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786954,
    "dDurationMs": 4725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I would say a grounded masculine\nthat I needed at that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792979,
    "dDurationMs": 1301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I love that. Cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794340,
    "dDurationMs": 4163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, you know, God bless him for being there for you,\nto actually be able to have someone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799044,
    "dDurationMs": 3763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in those moments, I can't imagine\nhow alone you must have felt, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803507,
    "dDurationMs": 4063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to not feel that you needed\nto 100% do it all alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807591,
    "dDurationMs": 3202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you definitely picked it all up\nand carried it all yourself, for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810833,
    "dDurationMs": 2982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you know, that first move of asking for help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813895,
    "dDurationMs": 3523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a very powerful move of you, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817618,
    "dDurationMs": 1862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's awesome of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819980,
    "dDurationMs": 5692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so I want to explore patterns and cycles\nand these sorts of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825692,
    "dDurationMs": 4813,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, when I was older, you know,\nin my later twenties,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830565,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure I'd probably heard it before, but, you know,\nin my early twenties and my teens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834768,
    "dDurationMs": 3342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had a bunch of patterns that I needed to break too,\nbut that wasn't in my vocabulary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838130,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't know, like, oh, this cycle, or, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840611,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I would kind of know, well, come on,\nI'm a black sheep of my family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843472,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I'm different than these people or whatever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845534,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I never really saw the magnitude of it\nthat I was going to be this, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849176,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, I need to, like, really destroy these patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851237,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and completely change the direction\nof our lineage and all this stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855979,
    "dDurationMs": 3743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was it like for you to kind of\nstart uncovering, like, yo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859942,
    "dDurationMs": 4162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a pattern that's not only happening with me,\nbut my family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864424,
    "dDurationMs": 1581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is like, I could stop this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866025,
    "dDurationMs": 2082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, you now look at your kids saying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868627,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're going to be free from this because it ends here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871228,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, how powerful is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872489,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was your kind of introspective insights\non that sort of stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876712,
    "dDurationMs": 3562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discovering patterns, breaking them,\ntrying to build a new version?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881249,
    "dDurationMs": 3961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely. So I would say that started for me\npost-spiritual awakening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885230,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had a spiritual awakening\nwhen I was 35 years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887971,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's when I really started\nto question my thoughts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893813,
    "dDurationMs": 4262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my patterns or my behaviors\nand my limiting beliefs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898675,
    "dDurationMs": 4262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that's when I realized that my thoughts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903825,
    "dDurationMs": 2964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "create my beliefs, and my beliefs create my reality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907470,
    "dDurationMs": 1862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in order to change my reality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909352,
    "dDurationMs": 4105,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those beliefs and those thoughts\nare instilled from when you're a child,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914368,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from how you're raised, the things you're told,\nthe people you look up to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919651,
    "dDurationMs": 3482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even the collective or society,\nhowever the programming is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923933,
    "dDurationMs": 3122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so what I realized is, like, I was holding on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927915,
    "dDurationMs": 3923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to these limitations and these ideas of myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932018,
    "dDurationMs": 5403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that were projections of other people's,\ntheir own inner work that they didn't do yet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938562,
    "dDurationMs": 4985,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "projecting it onto me. And I took that on\nas if it were mine and I owned it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943567,
    "dDurationMs": 4225,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I needed to realize, like, for example,\nmy mother, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950215,
    "dDurationMs": 3502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always felt like I had abandonment issues"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953857,
    "dDurationMs": 4302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because my mom and dad both left me\nwhen I was three years old"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959240,
    "dDurationMs": 1141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be raised by my grandmother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961201,
    "dDurationMs": 4482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I carried that wounded child that felt abandoned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965964,
    "dDurationMs": 2421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into my adulthood until I realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970176,
    "dDurationMs": 3762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a later age, post-awakening, that every single thing\nthat I went through was all necessary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973998,
    "dDurationMs": 2062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for my growth, for my evolution of my soul."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976880,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's when I can begin changing the story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981223,
    "dDurationMs": 4322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the patterns and the programs\nare basically stories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986105,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we tell ourselves.\nAnd we tell these same stories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990932,
    "dDurationMs": 2882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on repeat, becomes a cycle and becomes a reality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993854,
    "dDurationMs": 3842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so in order to change the pattern or disrupt it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998316,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to change the story, change the narrative,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000877,
    "dDurationMs": 2082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look at it through a different lens,\na different perspective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002999,
    "dDurationMs": 3001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there's limitless possibilities\nof why things could happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007061,
    "dDurationMs": 3241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I'm stuck on one idea\nand applying that meaning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010383,
    "dDurationMs": 5162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's what creates my inner disrupted world because\nit's not in alignment with who I truly am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016186,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I understood all of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019199,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the other thing that I did that's important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022100,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is I started changing the content\nthat I was consuming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027921,
    "dDurationMs": 5922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, pre-awakening,\nI was binge watching Netflix,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034743,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "numbing myself with that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038724,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "endlessly scrolling on social media,\nlooking for escapism,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044838,
    "dDurationMs": 5564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drinking alcohol, again, another numbing myself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051463,
    "dDurationMs": 5304,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and listening to this music, the frequency\nwas just not a good vibration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057308,
    "dDurationMs": 5724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So post-awakening, I started to pay attention\nto everything I was doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063673,
    "dDurationMs": 2602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and changing that.\nI started listening to audiobooks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067431,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changing what I was listening to,\nthings that will feed my soul, nourish me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072473,
    "dDurationMs": 4723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of it was, like, the first one\nthat changed everything for me was Abraham Hicks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077856,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the teachings of Abraham."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079377,
    "dDurationMs": 4482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was a really powerful one that helped me\nunderstand that I am the creator of my reality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084059,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and understand that I'm co-creating\nwith my thoughts and my words and my beliefs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088761,
    "dDurationMs": 3791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that really helped me\nrealize that I'm much bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092592,
    "dDurationMs": 3101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than this physical being that I live in,\nthis physical self."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097133,
    "dDurationMs": 3221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second thing that I started to do\nwas listen to podcasts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101414,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one that really changed my perspective\nin my life and helped me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105896,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because every day was a new challenge\nthat I had to overcome,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111017,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was The School of Greatness, because they have\ndifferent episodes on so many different topics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116099,
    "dDurationMs": 4382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it really helped me stop and think\nabout what I'm thinking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121141,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, okay, what is this thought?\nWhat is this idea? Where did it come from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124542,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is this even mine? Is this even true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127303,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And start challenging those thoughts\nso that I can change it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132585,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the third thing, I stopped listening to the music.\nI stopped watching the news."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136106,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I stopped even watching TV.\nI never turn on the TV now, like, ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141967,
    "dDurationMs": 5201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just really had to consume information\nthat was going to feed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147488,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and educate me in the way that I needed at that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154190,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Wow. Okay. I mean, yeah,\nwhat an incredible awakening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159402,
    "dDurationMs": 2342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know what I was thinking about?\nYou're aware of Tony Robbins, yeah?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162441,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, yes.\nYeah, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164242,
    "dDurationMs": 2182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure everybody listening is like,\nyeah, of course she is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167765,
    "dDurationMs": 3722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I always think about, he has this thing\nand he calls it priming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172487,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He literally has a thing online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174989,
    "dDurationMs": 4243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His 10-minute priming follow-along exercise\nis something that's fantastic, by the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179513,
    "dDurationMs": 3102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what he does before he goes out\nto his big events where he's teaching,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182635,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's healing people in arenas.\nIt's like thousands and thousands of people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187078,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He has a little mini trampoline.\nAnd he has it backstage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191379,
    "dDurationMs": 3683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he has, like, this mantra,\nthese, like, certain words that he says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195082,
    "dDurationMs": 4564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're not magic inherently by themselves,\nbut he has built them to be magic for himself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200247,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they prime him to be in the state\nthat he needs to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203109,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he could serve as many people\nand help as many people and do what he does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206912,
    "dDurationMs": 2662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he primes, it's like he jumps\non this little trampoline backstage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209614,
    "dDurationMs": 2101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think he like spins around\nand he says something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211735,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's like, it'd probably be funny\nfor anybody else to watch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214316,
    "dDurationMs": 5043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he's priming himself to now go serve\nand help thousands of people for,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219579,
    "dDurationMs": 2581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, what, 18 hours?\nThis guy just goes crazy at these events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223761,
    "dDurationMs": 3842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like you, Jess, you became aware\nthat you were being primed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228144,
    "dDurationMs": 1861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You became aware that Netflix was priming you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230525,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the music you were listening to was priming you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235108,
    "dDurationMs": 3383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The content you were consuming was priming you.\nPriming you for what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238851,
    "dDurationMs": 4483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To be in states of not creation, consumption,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244275,
    "dDurationMs": 4403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reactivity, rather than consciously choosing,\nwho do I want to be?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248838,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I want to think about today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250340,
    "dDurationMs": 4623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it sounds like you really became aware\nof these feelings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255724,
    "dDurationMs": 2862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I love that you shared that\nbecause I think that people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258866,
    "dDurationMs": 2302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "becoming aware and hearing that perspective\nthat you shared of,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262168,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder where I'm being primed\nwithout really realizing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265890,
    "dDurationMs": 2802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We kind of just do the same things all the time\nand we consume"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268712,
    "dDurationMs": 2901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without really realizing that\nthat's affecting our thoughts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271673,
    "dDurationMs": 2582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's affecting our body, our nervous system,\nhow we're feeling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274275,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how we're showing up in our relationships, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278597,
    "dDurationMs": 5202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, wow. So amongst this healing, you know,\nyou definitely attacked the intellectual side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284159,
    "dDurationMs": 2981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You definitely became aware. You're very intelligent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287160,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were like unpacking things and kind of throwing it\ninto, like, yourself and changing yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292362,
    "dDurationMs": 5282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along the way. Was somatics part of this for you,\nlike the body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297704,
    "dDurationMs": 4302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the nervous system, because a lot of what happens,\nand I'm sure you know this very well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302046,
    "dDurationMs": 2621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like our bodies get all tensed up,\nespecially with fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304687,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you were physically assaulted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307248,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was the body work like for you with this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310552,
    "dDurationMs": 5885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I'll tell you a little bit of some backstory,\na few different things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316758,
    "dDurationMs": 2082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. So 2008, when my daughter was born,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321202,
    "dDurationMs": 2522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was the year, you know,\nI had just survived the abuse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325406,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I met my first husband.\nI was pregnant when I met him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330239,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is like post-abuse,\nlike maybe a week or two later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335447,
    "dDurationMs": 3685,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this guy walks into my office and asked me out.\nHe's been asking me out for like two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340201,
    "dDurationMs": 3741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I kept telling him, no, no, no.\nI threw away his number. I was in a relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344722,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then that day he came into my office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347963,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was just like,\nhe invited me to dinner and I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353105,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, but I'm pregnant.\nHe's like, I don't care."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356986,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, that doesn't matter to me.\nAnd he was willing to take that on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360187,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I feel like God sent him in my life,\nobviously for a reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362467,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I could have a safe space\nto bring my daughter into the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365489,
    "dDurationMs": 3926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He really took care of me and loved me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369435,
    "dDurationMs": 2724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To this day, we're friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373620,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The relationship didn't work out\nbecause that year I had just survived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377903,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I'm pregnant with my daughter.\nMy hormones are going crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380784,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My father died that year and my cousin died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384046,
    "dDurationMs": 2902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these are the first deaths\nI've ever experienced in my life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387548,
    "dDurationMs": 2462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I'm having a baby. I just gave birth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390310,
    "dDurationMs": 4142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was so much that I stored in my body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394472,
    "dDurationMs": 6124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like grief and sadness and all these things\nthat I didn't even realize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400776,
    "dDurationMs": 2842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just kept going to survive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403678,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, just getting through the day.\nLike, I have to be a mom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407000,
    "dDurationMs": 3683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having to hold my shit together\nand not realizing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411043,
    "dDurationMs": 4863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much was really, like, in me\nthat I never processed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415986,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that emotion, it doesn't go anywhere.\nIt's energy, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418868,
    "dDurationMs": 3203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it gets stored in different parts of your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422611,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So fast forward, when you don't allow\nyour emotions to express,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1427134,
    "dDurationMs": 2682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it shows up in other ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430296,
    "dDurationMs": 5456,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why I believe I began\nnumbing myself with alcohol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435852,
    "dDurationMs": 3842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and doing all these things that I find myself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440394,
    "dDurationMs": 2601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, in my second marriage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444216,
    "dDurationMs": 6202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is fast forward, I think 13 years.\nMy daughter's 13 now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450438,
    "dDurationMs": 2802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I have a realization that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454270,
    "dDurationMs": 3502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is, I'm in my kitchen,\nI'm on autopilot, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458213,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Completely just going through the motions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461175,
    "dDurationMs": 3742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "numb, disconnected, not feeling anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465478,
    "dDurationMs": 4363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what happens when you don't allow\nyour emotions to express. You numb yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469941,
    "dDurationMs": 2422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you just become the shell of a human being."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478053,
    "dDurationMs": 1082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was so subtle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479736,
    "dDurationMs": 4706,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was in my kitchen and this question\nfrom within me arose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484502,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like a moment of stillness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486766,
    "dDurationMs": 5467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just one moment, because I never allowed myself time\nto really even pay attention to my breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493048,
    "dDurationMs": 3623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How am I breathing? How am I doing?\nHow is my body? I didn't know any of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496891,
    "dDurationMs": 4483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't even think about it because I was busy\nbeing everything for everyone else,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502015,
    "dDurationMs": 2142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keeping the house together,\nworking a nine-to-five job,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504177,
    "dDurationMs": 4003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being the employee, the wife, the mom,\nall the things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509280,
    "dDurationMs": 2102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the question was, who am I?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512583,
    "dDurationMs": 3923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, whoa,\nit really stopped me in my tracks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517547,
    "dDurationMs": 1301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, who am I?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520637,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like I could give all the titles,\nbut I had no idea who I was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524339,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was so disconnected. Who am I?\nWhat is my purpose? Why am I here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528580,
    "dDurationMs": 3442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is this? What is this life about?\nNo freaking clue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532082,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, oh shit, I don't know who I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534362,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I enjoy?\nWhat are the things that bring me happiness?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538324,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the second question was, are you happy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541725,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And instantly I was like, no, I'm not happy.\nI'm not happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547088,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had the house, right? We had the big house,\nthe white picket fence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551230,
    "dDurationMs": 3702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, we had the careers, the cars,\nall the things from the outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554952,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would make it look like\nwe had everything, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558894,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But inside, empty. The marriage was dead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562775,
    "dDurationMs": 2182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were so disconnected.\nWe were basically roommates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565057,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was no love, romance, connection, nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569093,
    "dDurationMs": 3842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My kids ran over me, disrespected me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573016,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't look at me as, like, the source,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576898,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't see the sacrifices that I have made\nand just, like, wanted more and more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1580440,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like everybody just wanted to suck the life out of me,\nit felt like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584563,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was just giving, I was over-giving\nfrom an empty cup and I was depleted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590226,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in that moment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1593410,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when that question came up, are you happy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596696,
    "dDurationMs": 2405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was my husband at the time.\nHe walks in the door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600340,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I felt, for the first time,\nI paid attention to my breath"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605562,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my chest tightened.\nAnd I felt like I couldn't breathe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609303,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I was suffocating in my own life.\nAnd like I had an elephant sitting on my chest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614325,
    "dDurationMs": 3241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that answered everything for me.\nAnd I was like, no, I'm not happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617626,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I have to make changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619366,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I knew in those moments that I needed\nto make some really hard decisions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624288,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I needed to choose me. Like, it was time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626609,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because my soul, my spirit\nwas dying in that relationship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632170,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in that life, because that life\nwasn't a reflection of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635831,
    "dDurationMs": 3961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a reflection of this version of myself\nthat I had created of what I thought,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640812,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, what other people told me\nI should be, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644093,
    "dDurationMs": 3641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was like, oh, you know,\n15-year-old mom, and look at me now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647754,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm living in Florida.\nI have this big house and all these things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649894,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're not happy, what is it all for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655003,
    "dDurationMs": 5322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then later, so we'll get to, like,\nthe really somatic processing work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662606,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your body will speak to you in so many ways\nand it's up to you to really pay attention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666828,
    "dDurationMs": 3882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's so many things that I know now\nthat I didn't know back then of, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671930,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how wise our body is,\nhow intelligent our bodies are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678393,
    "dDurationMs": 4126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, I was experiencing a betrayal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1683220,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't know that I was experiencing a betrayal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686300,
    "dDurationMs": 4442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a pretty heavy one too. And my body knew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691582,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my body started forming this lipoma\non my back, on the left side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696323,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right by my heart.\nThere was this big ball of fat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700542,
    "dDurationMs": 5904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I realized years later, three years later,\nwhy that was forming on my back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706606,
    "dDurationMs": 3722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was my body protecting me\nfrom a literal stab in the back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711068,
    "dDurationMs": 2902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the betrayal that was happening.\nAnd the left side is the feminine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714030,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was a woman in my life betraying me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716971,
    "dDurationMs": 3282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had an energetic massage, and the energy...\nhe told me, he's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720825,
    "dDurationMs": 3945,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a stab in the back.\nSomebody is betraying you and it's a woman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724810,
    "dDurationMs": 3824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the next night, I ran into my sister."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728654,
    "dDurationMs": 2362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm like, okay, the universe is talking to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731436,
    "dDurationMs": 3043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just gives you so much information.\nIt's up to you to pay attention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734499,
    "dDurationMs": 3603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was like, okay, so I know my sister is betraying me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738122,
    "dDurationMs": 2542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because she's coming up with my reality\nafter I find out this information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740704,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was my sister and my daughter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741925,
    "dDurationMs": 6225,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, okay, I don't know how she's betraying me,\nbut I now have this information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748170,
    "dDurationMs": 1922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know she has or is, or I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751193,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I go on this plant medicine journey in Colombia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756427,
    "dDurationMs": 5382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did an ayahuasca retreat.\nIt's five days, four ceremonies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762970,
    "dDurationMs": 4181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the medicine started just moving things in me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767231,
    "dDurationMs": 2982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started, you know, moving things around,\nunderstanding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772866,
    "dDurationMs": 2842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my purpose, my role,\nwhat my soul chose to come here to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775728,
    "dDurationMs": 5484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to disrupt the patterns, to change everything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781252,
    "dDurationMs": 3762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, from my ancestors,\nthe lineage of what they believe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785074,
    "dDurationMs": 4183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that my lineage, so that my daughters\ncan have this understanding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789277,
    "dDurationMs": 4483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of limitless possibilities, that we don't have to live\nwithin the limitations and the beliefs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793820,
    "dDurationMs": 4383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that everyone else before us had or still has."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801263,
    "dDurationMs": 4706,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was after this medicine journey that I went on\nthat I received the information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805989,
    "dDurationMs": 3325,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the betrayal. The stab in the back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809334,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want to hear what it was?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1811937,
    "dDurationMs": 3485,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I do. Should we continue?\nYes, please. Keep going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817068,
    "dDurationMs": 3965,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm in Colombia by myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821053,
    "dDurationMs": 3764,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I took a three-month hiatus\nwhere I'm like, I need to go within."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1825798,
    "dDurationMs": 2824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because before that,\nI was just traveling the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828642,
    "dDurationMs": 3143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was traveling three weeks out of the month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831966,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was home for like a week,\nfor like two years straight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836470,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it just was so much on my body and on me.\nI'm like, you know what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840351,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need to really go within."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842452,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the universe was like, you're done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845973,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're going to go sit with yourself\nand figure out who you are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850034,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I did the ayahuasca."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857055,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a week later, my sister sends me a text message."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860276,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the text message, it's just a picture\nof her and my ex-husband."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865128,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And apparently they were in a relationship\nfor three years behind my back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869849,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had no idea.\nI would have never guessed it, to be honest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873730,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I understood that I received the information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878171,
    "dDurationMs": 3261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I was ready to,\nand when I was in a whole nother country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881792,
    "dDurationMs": 3741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there was no, like, immediate reaction,\nlike, oh, I'm going to go over there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885573,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I was in another country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889694,
    "dDurationMs": 3801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait, so she just texted you a photo\nof them together with no context?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894140,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No context. And it was a group text."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897082,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me and my ex-husband,\napparently they got into a fight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899884,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't want to be with her anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901104,
    "dDurationMs": 4223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she's like, okay, well, since you don't want\nto be with me, I'm going to go ahead and expose you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905447,
    "dDurationMs": 4043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because at that time, my ex-husband and I\nhad a cordial relationship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909510,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least so I thought,\nbecause we were married for nine years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912712,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And post-divorce, I'm like, okay, well,\nwe can keep a cordial relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916814,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My daughter still wanted a relationship with him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920000,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though he's not her biological father,\nbut he was in her life since she was four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925100,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she wanted to keep a relationship with him.\nI didn't. I was like, I'm done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930000,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was not happy in that marriage.\nWhen I'm done, I end the chapter. It's over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1934800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But she didn't allow that.\nSo he stayed in my life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he was doing some really dark stuff,\nreally behind my back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941500,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And obviously he went and put his claws\ninto my sister"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944900,
    "dDurationMs": 3463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because he wanted to keep tabs on me\nand what I was doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948819,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really some crazy, yeah,\nsuper dark stuff, super dark stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952500,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then my sister, I had no idea that she,\nthis is my little sister."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's two years younger than me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958200,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I moved her from Milwaukee to Florida\nbecause I wanted to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961500,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always had this complex that I need to, like, save her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1964600,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I realized you can't save anyone,\nor help her in some way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1968000,
    "dDurationMs": 4258,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm like, she's going to end up dead or in jail\nbecause she's just very sick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973946,
    "dDurationMs": 4054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's just a very rough person.\nShe has a lot of my dad's traits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My dad was in prison and all this stuff.\nSo she carries a lot of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1982400,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I felt a need to help her. So I moved her\ninto my home right before I got divorced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she was living with me in my home\nwith my husband."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991300,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when I moved out,\nshe moved into my apartment with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1995259,
    "dDurationMs": 3941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were going through my things.\nThey stole my identity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999200,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like they were just doing all kinds of stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002300,
    "dDurationMs": 3725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She was keeping track on my GPS\nof like where I was and..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2006734,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were tracking me together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't really suspect any of this?\nNo, at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011200,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't realize you were being betrayed like this?\nNo, I had no idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2015300,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no idea that she felt that way about me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017900,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because in my mind, I'm like, oh, she's my sister.\nWe're best friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2021800,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're always going to be best friends.\nWe even had matching tattoos. It was crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2026500,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were looking out for her, yeah.\nYeah, and so all of that was happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that was a really heavy betrayal\nthat I had to swallow and really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035624,
    "dDurationMs": 4776,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sit with and accept and allow myself\nto feel the emotions of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2040400,
    "dDurationMs": 5366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like these are two people that I loved\nthat did this out of hatred for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046222,
    "dDurationMs": 3678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm like, okay, take myself out of being a victim."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049900,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't do anything to me.\nThey're just projecting their own unhealed wounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2055300,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was a source of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057100,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then understanding the story and creating\na new one so that I can free myself from that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063300,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I could choose, okay,\ndo I want to be angry, resentful, hateful?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2067900,
    "dDurationMs": 5085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I want to react, you know,\nin the same energy that they're putting out?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073407,
    "dDurationMs": 3593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, and this is, again,\npost-medicine ceremony, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The medicine kept saying, choose love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079400,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm like, or do I choose love\nand forgiveness and compassion to understand?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084700,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2085800,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for me, I'm like, no, I know what that feels like\nto be angry and resentful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2091100,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I'm right there with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093674,
    "dDurationMs": 4926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not what I want for me\nand that's not what I choose for myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098600,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So fast forward, I understood like, you know what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102000,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The narrative that I'm going to give this\nis that this is a great love story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2107100,
    "dDurationMs": 4394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They gave me an opportunity\nto choose love in the face of betrayal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112152,
    "dDurationMs": 2048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what I'm going to choose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2114200,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I had to look at it like,\nbecause they love me so much, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From a soul perspective, because our human minds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120800,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we don't really understand why these things happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2123700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on a soul perspective, I needed to evolve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2126300,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gave me the opportunity\nto evolve in a way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2129200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I wouldn't have had without that experience, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2132400,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without that information.\nSo I had to look at it completely different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2136200,
    "dDurationMs": 3374,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and understand that forgiveness\nis not a one and done thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139962,
    "dDurationMs": 3038,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a continual choice, forgiving someone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2143000,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking yourself out of being a victim,\nfinding compassion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146900,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, who are these people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2148700,
    "dDurationMs": 4796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is that pain that's so deep within them\nthat they felt that need?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154289,
    "dDurationMs": 5211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they're a victim in their own life, you know,\nand that is a prison in itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2159500,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I don't want to imprison myself.\nI'm not a victim."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These things happen so that I can grow and evolve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2166000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then looking at it that way\nreally freed me from all of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2170000,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so did you have to form, like,\na perspective of..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2173500,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, because how do you default to starting\nto listen to your soul's perspective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178700,
    "dDurationMs": 5137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than, like, well, this stinks right now,\nlike, I'm mad about this, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184175,
    "dDurationMs": 2936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah. No, because,\nwell, I had to allow myself to feel it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2187499,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was angry. I cried. I grieved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189900,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, sadness, anger, all the things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2192800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I allowed myself to feel it,\nbut I didn't stay there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2196700,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So allowing these emotions to come up,\nunderstanding that that is part of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2202500,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is part of the experience,\nis that these emotions are going to come up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because these are people that I loved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211000,
    "dDurationMs": 4427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that stabbed me in the heart\nin such a way that I was like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215866,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it blindsided me. And I was like, whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I needed to feel that. Why did I need to feel that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2222500,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because there was something in that\nthat was going to help me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2226900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be who I am today, to help other people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2229900,
    "dDurationMs": 4647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I don't know. It's just,\nplus I was already on the journey of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2235238,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diving deep into the soul, like deep, deep, deep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2238900,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I was reading every book about the soul,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2242400,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Seat of the Soul, like all the things,\nDolores Cannon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2246700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was studying QHHT,\nQuantum Healing Hypnosis Therapy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2250900,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a lot about, you know, past lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2254200,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and these contracts that we have with these people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257900,
    "dDurationMs": 6195,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, I just wanted to gain an understanding\nthat was beyond human perception."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264618,
    "dDurationMs": 2182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was already on that journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2266800,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's just, like I said, this information\ncame to me at the perfect time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2271500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because had I found out in the beginning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2274200,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would have been a different perspective,\na different outcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2278300,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You would have burned their house down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2280800,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it would have been something completely\nwild and chaotic and dramatic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2285700,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because I received the information\nwhen I was a more evolved version of myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2291100,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and able to go deeper and, like, sit with it,\nI had to really sit with everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2296200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I went and did another ayahuasca retreat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2299400,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it helped me really process everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2302100,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by the end of it, I felt so much bliss\nthat I allowed myself to release the anger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307700,
    "dDurationMs": 3017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I understood I held the anger in my chest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2311105,
    "dDurationMs": 6795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it just sat there, and I was like,\nit's okay to feel anger. It's okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2317900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, allowing myself to feel it, to, like, ah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2321300,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like, almost like a roaring, like a lion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2324800,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "releasing this anger that was held in my chest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328500,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I did that, it felt so powerful. And, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2332600,
    "dDurationMs": 5977,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you can move forward\nwhen you can allow yourself to just feel anger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338847,
    "dDurationMs": 4353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Yeah. The term feel, I do,\nI'm pretty into meditation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2343200,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, the term feel, like,\nfeel the breath coming in and out of your belly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2349200,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes people a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2351100,
    "dDurationMs": 5230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took me a while to where it's like,\nwell, what do you mean, feel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2356330,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you're like, okay, the physical sensations,\nyou start kind of becoming aware of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, my shirt's kind of gently rustling\nagainst my belly there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2363900,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, after a while,\nI can kind of feel the air coming in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's kind of crazy because, you know,\nwe use this term feel or I feel like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2370700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's part of our vocabulary all the time.\nFeel, feel, feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373600,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're kind of so disconnected from really feeling it.\nAnd we just verbalize it all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378300,
    "dDurationMs": 5401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But feeling is really, like I said, it's the very\nsubtle things of feeling your shirt against your skin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383701,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And feeling where in your body is tightening up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2386700,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like that moment where your ex-husband\nwalked into the kitchen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2390500,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you were aware of what your body did.\nYour body closed up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394300,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then if you can kind of hold that meta perspective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2397700,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can kind of have that like,\noh, there I am shielding against something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2402280,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not really what I want to be doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you have that, you know, am I happy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2407300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you were able to answer that. So powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. So I'm thinking of anyone listening now\nwho, say that they're, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2414300,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're on their journey,\nthey're on their spiritual awakening journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2418200,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would assume that people are listening to this\npodcast or listening to our content here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2423300,
    "dDurationMs": 5643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're in an introspective state, you know, maybe\nthey're at the beginning or the end or whatever, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2429550,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to explore a little bit more on, like,\nthe body work side of things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2433500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even like breath work, that sort of stuff,\nlike the actual, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2437100,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it can be so easy to get caught up in the reading,\nin the audiobooks and the podcasts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2442100,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're just, like, eating\n12 hours a day of YouTube videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2445400,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, I love doing that kind of stuff,\nbut I definitely had to, I had to find yoga."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2450000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to find, like, really doing the work.\nI had to do hours of this stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2454000,
    "dDurationMs": 3343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it helped me understand\nand release things in my own body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2457343,
    "dDurationMs": 2957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can I ask you a little bit more specifically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2460300,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, what are some of the practices that you teach,\nthat you share at your retreats,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2465400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you do, that helps for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2467400,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely. So I believe, I mean,\nthe mind-body connection is powerful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2471800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also connecting to your heart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2473800,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the only way you can do that is doing\nthe meditation, the breath work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2478300,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paying attention to your breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2480884,
    "dDurationMs": 4016,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, it's like what I started doing,\nlike when I first meditate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484900,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because a lot of times we think that our mind\nshould be silent during meditation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2489500,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not true because you really\ncannot truly silence your mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2493600,
    "dDurationMs": 2404,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what you can do is redirect your focus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2496409,
    "dDurationMs": 2391,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can redirect your focus to your breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2498800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then anytime a thought arises,\nnot to get attached to it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2501900,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because when you attach yourself to a thought,\nthat creates more of the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2506000,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you just release the attachment to the thought\nand redirect your focus into the breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2510700,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, breathing in for four breaths,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2512710,
    "dDurationMs": 6190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "holding it, and then breathing out.\nThis just, like, gets you in a different state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2518900,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I tried different breathing modalities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2522000,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also did this breathwork, which was,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2524900,
    "dDurationMs": 5478,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that one is, I think, I want to say\nit's like a two-hour long of, like, just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2530817,
    "dDurationMs": 5983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heavy, powerful breath work\nwhere you're reaching the point of DMT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2536800,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I did that a couple times.\nThat was really intense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2541800,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do yoga, especially when I did\nthat three-month hiatus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2546900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did yoga every day, four times a day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2550350,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and really was connecting with my body"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2552500,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it can get uncomfortable in those positions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2555300,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's breathing through the discomfort\nand connecting with your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2559200,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, your body will love you for it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2561500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because your body is its own universe on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2564200,
    "dDurationMs": 4393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's just, like, really nourishing yourself,\nand that is a form of self-care."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2569049,
    "dDurationMs": 7651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I also do that I love, and I found\npost-divorce, finding myself, was dancing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I dance sensual bachata."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579300,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That in itself is a spiritual journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2582800,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you discover, one, ways that your body\ncan move that you didn't know before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2590800,
    "dDurationMs": 3443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understood, like, in the beginning..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2594243,
    "dDurationMs": 4457,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I first started learning the dance,\nmy body was so stiff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598700,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was because it was holding on to so much\nenergy that I didn't even realize,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2604600,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, I could hardly move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606400,
    "dDurationMs": 4685,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even now, I still feel in my body parts\nwhere it's just like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2611878,
    "dDurationMs": 1622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wants to release."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613500,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And dance really helped me move the energy\nbecause you're moving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2618800,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're constantly moving your body,\nyou're flowing with the music."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2623900,
    "dDurationMs": 3047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And sensual bachata is a partner dance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2626947,
    "dDurationMs": 3653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then I'm having to trust a partner, follow a lead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2630600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really helped me get into my feminine\nbecause I was so in my masculine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2635600,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was in such, like, survival mode and hustle mentality\nprior to, because of my marriage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2641600,
    "dDurationMs": 2391,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't really provide anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2644379,
    "dDurationMs": 5921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did 50-50. I always had to pay more,\nso I was hustling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2650300,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were in survival, seriously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2653400,
    "dDurationMs": 5475,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to learn to let go, trust my lead,\nto be patient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2659229,
    "dDurationMs": 2871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to allow him to lead me into the next move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2662100,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because if I'm thinking ahead of, like, oh,\nI know what the next move is going to be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2667500,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I completely mess up the dance. And then\nit just changes the whole dance, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2672900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so it's like, okay, be here now in this moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2676300,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, really teaching me presence\nbecause that's the only moment that actually exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2682300,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how to be in my body,\nhow to have grace with my body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686100,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if I mess up, even if I miss a step."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2689300,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just being free and, like, sensual and playful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2691700,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, like, understanding all the things\nthat the body can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2694800,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the connection part,\nthat's really beautiful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2697600,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But dance has really changed my life.\nI love dancing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2700400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is one of my favorite things to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2702400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, it's really a meditation for me.\nIt's a moving meditation for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2706400,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I'm focusing on my breath.\nI'm focusing on my movement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2709700,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing that really taught me\nis not to worry about what anybody else thinks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2714200,
    "dDurationMs": 1982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because everyone is in their own dance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2716773,
    "dDurationMs": 5927,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I'm not in my own dance and I'm paying\nattention to the next dance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2722700,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to mess up my dance.\nBecause I have to be in my dance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2728200,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To have a good dance, you have to be in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2731700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And not every dance is a good dance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2734600,
    "dDurationMs": 5697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it just reminds me of a parallel of life.\nSo that, I would say..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2740786,
    "dDurationMs": 3714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Find what you love.\nFind something that brings you true joy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2744500,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're on your spiritual journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2746700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "find something that is going to awaken\nyour soul, your spirit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2750400,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bring you so much happiness that it becomes\na part of you. For me, dance was that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2755300,
    "dDurationMs": 5550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you have any, when you were a child,\ndid you like dancing? Do you remember? Do you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2761373,
    "dDurationMs": 4227,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love dancing. I always loved dancing.\nI just never took classes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2765600,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My grandma couldn't afford it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2767500,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And honestly, I would get in trouble for dancing.\nAnything I did, I would get in trouble for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2773600,
    "dDurationMs": 3484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just couldn't live.\nMy grandma was such a strict woman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2777523,
    "dDurationMs": 3977,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, my childhood wasn't the greatest,\nbut I love dancing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2781500,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I always, like, felt so restricted in that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2784600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this just gave me such a way\nto just feel, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2788200,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The spirit likes to dance.\nThe spirit likes to play."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2791700,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The spirit came here to be happy,\nenjoy this human experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2795800,
    "dDurationMs": 4099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, we get to be here to walk this earth.\nIt's such a gift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2799899,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all fluid, baby. It's all fluid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2802700,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah. I like,\nAlan Watts has that quote about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2806600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, dancing is the purpose within itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2809900,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you're not dancing to get\nto the other end of the room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2814400,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fastest or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2816900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really is forced presence, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2819900,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think so many, the fluid movements\nthat are invited in dancing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2825100,
    "dDurationMs": 2356,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, in yoga too, really, but..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2828384,
    "dDurationMs": 3616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was listening to this thing yesterday,\nso it's kind of fresh on my mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2832000,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This guy was talking about,\nhe's one of these weird movement guys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2835200,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Weird in the best way. I mean, that's a compliment.\nI'm a weird guy myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2838900,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he's just very anti-weightlifting gym.\nHe's just very fluid movement and natural movements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2843600,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He doesn't lift weights, whatever.\nBut he was saying we've kind of been told that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2847925,
    "dDurationMs": 4075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, the weightlifting side of things\nis your spine is a fence post"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2852000,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it needs to stay sturdy and you need to,\nlike, isolate this thing. You know what I mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2857100,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And obviously that's helpful\nin certain areas in so many ways,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2860700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm excited for the future of, you know,\nmore of a holistic approach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2864900,
    "dDurationMs": 5115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to how our bodies and our minds are fitting together.\nAnd I could see dancing be, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2870015,
    "dDurationMs": 4185,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more accepted, you know, like more,\nobviously it's not that dancing isn't accepted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2874200,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I could see more people, like,\nactively who go to the gym"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2877300,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're trying to work on their physique,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2879400,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're also unafraid to dance, you know,\nbecause it connects us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2882700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and makes us feel, you know,\nat peace with our mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2885300,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if people can connect the mental health,\nlike, if you could take,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2888700,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say you dance for 45 minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2890300,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you do one of the classes that you were doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2892600,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you walk out of that class,\nhow do you feel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2895300,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's probably amazing.\nIf you could put that in a pill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2898100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people would just be like, dude, sign me up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2901000,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, yeah, I just, you know,\nI hope that more and more people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2904700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discover the power of things like dance\nand fluid movement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2908400,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. And what's really beautiful about this\nis my daughter just started dancing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2913300,
    "dDurationMs": 944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I love that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2914683,
    "dDurationMs": 4217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, and so now, and I'm like, oh,\nI wish that when I was 17 or 18"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2918900,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I started that journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2920700,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but mine didn't start until I was 35."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2923000,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for her, it gets to start younger\nand she gets to experience it and feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2927800,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see if that's something that she truly enjoys.\nAnd so far she's been having a great time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2933700,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so it's like, I get to go dancing\nwith my daughter. It's really fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2939084,
    "dDurationMs": 3816,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have any kids,\nbut I imagine that's got to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2942900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most time-stopping moment to witness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2945900,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really cool because she's such a powerful light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2949700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's a magnet. Her energy is magnetic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2952600,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bringing her into the dance community,\nshe's like this new shiny object."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2957700,
    "dDurationMs": 6443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They just fall in love with her. She's just\na beautiful soul. It's really something amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2964785,
    "dDurationMs": 4615,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Yeah. Okay. So cool. Okay. Well,\nI kind of wanted to talk a little bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2969400,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had written it down on my notes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2971300,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love hearing more details on ayahuasca\nexperiences, psychedelic trips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2975200,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can't be alone, right? I think that\nthere's other people who love these,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2979600,
    "dDurationMs": 2465,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, 15-minute clips from podcasts\nof ayahuasca trips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2982065,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can we talk a little bit more?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2983900,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would love to assume that someone who's listening,\nmaybe they've never heard of ayahuasca."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2988800,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so they're like, this is going to be\na weird thing for them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2992200,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm not asking you to explain,\nit's this tree root and this thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2995900,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have to give the whole history of ayahuasca."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2998700,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But from someone who's kind of\nunfamiliar with this stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3001700,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what do you mean you went to the jungle and you drank\na drink and then puked and you felt better?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3006800,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are you talking about?\nIt's so ridiculous, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3010752,
    "dDurationMs": 5748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is. I've done probably almost every\nplant medicine you can think of. Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3016500,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've done ayahuasca, bufo, yopo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3019000,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Egyptian elixir, which is acacia,\nreally powerful medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3023600,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the coolest name too, Egyptian elixir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3027000,
    "dDurationMs": 4424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, super powerful. So I've done DMT.\nI've probably done..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3032977,
    "dDurationMs": 4723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've done a wide range of psychedelics\nin the past couple of years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3037700,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for me, how I would describe it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3040200,
    "dDurationMs": 4775,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is a very powerful indigenous plant medicine\nthat was given to..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3045785,
    "dDurationMs": 5815,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the indigenous tribes, it is something\nto be honored, respected, and revered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3051600,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it is not something to play with.\nAnd I wouldn't say it's for everyone either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3057900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would say if you feel a calling in your heart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3061300,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to dive deeper into what it is\nand go on that journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3065300,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just know you will never be the same\nbecause you're going to learn and go deep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3071890,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I learned from my own experience\nwith this medicine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3075400,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that this experience, this human experience,\nis just a reflection of self."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3079800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, it is just me experiencing myself\nin human form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3082900,
    "dDurationMs": 4971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's like the creator, right? The creator,\nGod, source, whatever you want to call it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3089508,
    "dDurationMs": 2992,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "created creation to experience itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3092500,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm a reflection of that,\nmeaning that I have the God spark in me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3097800,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We all have the God spark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3099700,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are all having our own human experience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3103100,
    "dDurationMs": 5747,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "living through our perspectives and beliefs\nof what it looks like, so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3109673,
    "dDurationMs": 3427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of that, all of the experience that we have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3113100,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is so that God can experience\nhis creation in human form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3117200,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I learned that with the medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3119700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I discovered my gifts with this medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3122600,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I discovered that my voice is my gift,\nwhich I had no idea before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3127400,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I discovered what my soul came here to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3130400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The medicine will speak to you\nand give you information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3134400,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you need it to learn more about yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3137500,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do these come up for you? Did it come up, like,\nduring the ceremony, during the trip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3143700,
    "dDurationMs": 4968,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or was it, like, the next day\nthat you had these introspectives, or?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3150119,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the ceremony. So the ceremony\nwill take you, excuse me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3154700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In ceremony, when the medicine connects with you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3158400,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I will say this,\nI've done ayahuasca more than 30 times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3163100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And each ceremony is a different journey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3166100,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you're going through\ndifferent experiences in your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3170900,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're needing to understand things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3173500,
    "dDurationMs": 5728,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes your stuff is coming up\nfor the collective that needs to be purged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3179853,
    "dDurationMs": 4747,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not easy. It's like I really came out of this\nfeeling like a true warrior"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3184600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I'm like, okay, I'm going in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3187000,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not fun. It's not easy,\nbut I will say it's worth it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3190500,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it literally alters and changes your DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3193300,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because now you have information\nyou can never unknow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3196600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the medicine will give you information.\nIt is a guide, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3200600,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a tool that you get to use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3202600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You still have free will and choice.\nWhat do you do with that information?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3207000,
    "dDurationMs": 1726,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, my book is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3209637,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was information given to me from ayahuasca."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3214800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it was my choice to write it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3218400,
    "dDurationMs": 6256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I do with this information?\nDo I write the book?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3225247,
    "dDurationMs": 3853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And give this vulnerability,\nbe this vulnerable version of myself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3229100,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or do I not and just continue on the same?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3231500,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you still have a choice to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3233700,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, for example, like that ceremony,\nI was hearing my story narrated in my mind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3238400,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was the first time that I ever heard my story\nin a way that it sounded beautiful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3243500,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I always viewed my life as,\nlike, this tragedy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3246700,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of something I had to survive and get through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3249500,
    "dDurationMs": 2898,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the medicine was like, your life is your gift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3252888,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't go through all of this\nto keep it to yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3256100,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you went through all of this.\nYou learned the lessons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3259300,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You now have this wisdom, this embodied wisdom\nthat you didn't have before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3263500,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was my duty to write the book.\nIt was my obligation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3266600,
    "dDurationMs": 2623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I needed to share everything that I've learned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3269813,
    "dDurationMs": 4187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With other humans, because we're all\nhaving this human experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3274000,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're all going through shit, right?\nHow do you get through it? What is the perspective?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3279500,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I needed to share my views with the world\nfrom my heart. That was the inspiration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3284900,
    "dDurationMs": 4235,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the medicine completely changed my life.\nAnd I will say, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3289388,
    "dDurationMs": 5112,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is an initiation, a rite of passage\nwhen the medicine connects with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3294500,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because my first six ceremonies, I didn't really\nconnect and I didn't even know it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3300200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I would receive downloads and information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3303400,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was during ceremony\nand also after ceremony"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3306900,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the medicine continues\nto work with you, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3310600,
    "dDurationMs": 3139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The real ceremony, the real ceremony is life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3314363,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the real ceremony.\nThat is the true medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3317700,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am the medicine, right? I understood that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3320500,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But ayahuasca gave me the awareness of that,\nthat I didn't have before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3325000,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because, you know, we seek things, right?\nWe seek meaning. We seek understanding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3330200,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We seek this deeper, like, we really want to know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3333300,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We want to know, why are we here? What is this\nall about? What is the meaning of this all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3339000,
    "dDurationMs": 2785,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the medicine helps me understand that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3342781,
    "dDurationMs": 5319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the true meaning is,\nhow do I respond when life shows its teeth?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3348100,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I do in those moments?\nFor example, the betrayal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3352500,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yesterday, I blew up at my daughter.\nShe triggered the shit out of me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3358000,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we had a moment where we're going at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3361500,
    "dDurationMs": 3826,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I needed to go step outside and take a walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3365900,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, no, not today, Satan. We're not doing this.\nYou're not triggering me today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3370700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But either way, you're still in this human experience.\nYou can't escape it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3375000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no escaping it.\nIt's what do you do with it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3378000,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I knew that I needed to step into more of myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3382066,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Discovering my voice, sharing my story,\ntalking about it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3385900,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "releasing shame, being vulnerable,\nnot carrying guilt or anger or resentment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3390800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being able to forgive my parents\nfor not knowing any better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3394700,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understanding that everyone's on their own journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3400031,
    "dDurationMs": 2569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a school. Earth is a school, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3402600,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We all have different levels of consciousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3405300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like in school, there's different grade levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3408300,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's understanding and accepting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3410400,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's just where they're at on their journey.\nThat's okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3413700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have to change anyone.\nI didn't come here to change anyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3417400,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I want somebody to change, I need to look\nat myself. What needs to change within me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3422300,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I had all these deep understandings\nand awarenesses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3425700,
    "dDurationMs": 2985,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the medicine,\nI wouldn't have had without it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3429005,
    "dDurationMs": 3195,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. Yeah, I'm thinking of,\nI'm reading Harry Potter again right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3432200,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm thinking of, like, you know, imagine\nthe sixth and seventh years at Hogwarts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3436000,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just making fun of the first years\nfor not being able to do magic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3439100,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, like, feeling better than them\nbecause they don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3441900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, they're just in school, man.\nThey're just a first year. That's all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3445500,
    "dDurationMs": 4228,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're just in a different year than them.\nYou know, so one thing that I caught from you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3450032,
    "dDurationMs": 3968,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You said just yesterday that you had\nan argument with your daughter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3454000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you're telling me, Jess,\nis that this ayahuasca stuff that you took"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3458400,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't just magically heal you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3459900,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're not just, like,\na perfectly enlightened being?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3463100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you mean?\nIs there really a magical pill?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3466000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, you're still in the human experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3468400,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your shit's going to fucking trigger you\nbecause you still have stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3472500,
    "dDurationMs": 1865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, we are going to constantly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3474855,
    "dDurationMs": 4545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have to grow through things.\nIt's constant. It's continual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3479400,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Life doesn't end. You become more aware.\nI became aware."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3483600,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I even told her, you are triggering me right now.\nYou need to stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3488800,
    "dDurationMs": 5714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She was just in a mood and we're going at it.\nI needed to take a step back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3494953,
    "dDurationMs": 4147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and go breathe. Like, no, no, no, no.\nRecalibrate myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3499100,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and talk it out with one of my friends.\nLike, this is what's happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3504300,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, just having a friend,\na woman that's also a mother, helps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3509700,
    "dDurationMs": 3343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we understand each other. Like, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3513431,
    "dDurationMs": 4369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's what's happening here. You know,\nobviously these children come into our lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3517800,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we have soul contracts with them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3519900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they trigger us because they show us\nmore of ourselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3522900,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that helps us evolve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3524200,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it mean you're not going to have moments\nwhere you're reacting?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3527700,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even my daughter, she likes to judge me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3530000,
    "dDurationMs": 3124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's like, you're supposed to be\nthe spiritual person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3533124,
    "dDurationMs": 4576,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm still human. I am still human.\nYes, I'm spiritual in human form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3537700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So don't... yeah, I'm still on the path.\nI will beat your ass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3541900,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. No, you know, it's just funny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3544400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm reminded of Pema Chödrön,\nif you've read any of her work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3548400,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's a meditation teacher.\nShe's one of my favorite teachers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3552600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She talks openly about,\nshe's a grandmother, and she talks about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3557441,
    "dDurationMs": 3759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, things like that with her granddaughter,\nwhere, like, they're having a great day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3561200,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then she just gets super irritated\nabout something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3563500,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and her granddaughter is just, like,\nannoying the crap out of her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3566300,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, you know, her granddaughter will call her\nout about it, or, like, just blatantly state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3570500,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, oh, you're irritated, Grandma, or whatever.\nAnd then she has to just accept, like, oh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3574822,
    "dDurationMs": 2478,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, here I am.\nYou know, I'm this meditation teacher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3577300,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, like, got hundreds of thousands of people\nlistening to my books."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3580500,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here I am mad at my own granddaughter, you know,\nand that's the truth of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3584300,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I think so many, when people are on the outside\njust getting into a lot of this stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3588800,
    "dDurationMs": 4669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this meditation stuff, this healing stuff,\nthis learning about who you are and what you are, is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3593857,
    "dDurationMs": 2843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We kind of have these images that are, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3596700,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we don't think very deeply about the images\nthat we project onto, like, well, meditation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3601700,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, if you're into meditation, you're going to be\nthis peaceful person and you're never worried."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3607300,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're just going to sit crisscross applesauce\nand you're going to start wearing orange"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3612600,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, like, you're going to be a nun.\nAnd it's like, no, man, you were..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3617246,
    "dDurationMs": 4054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're learning to meditate to be our friend,\nto be a friend to ourselves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3621300,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to learn who we are and accept who we are\nand be okay with who we are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3625300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, we can become aware\nof those patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3628300,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we have a little bit of a wedge\nbecause of meditation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3631500,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can go, oh, here's an invitation\nto choose a different route."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3635400,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm kind of mad and I normally\nwould respond like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3638600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I have this awareness now of both options."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3641200,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me not freak out and take a breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3643908,
    "dDurationMs": 3892,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, so meditation\nallows us to see who we are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3647800,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it leaves room for allowing who we are\nso we can work from there. So, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3653200,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And having more compassion and grace\nfor those moments of, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3657600,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of going through your shit, like rage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3660300,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These emotions still exist, right?\nThey don't go away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3664000,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So allowing it to express, but not staying there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3667400,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, okay, I expressed it. We both released it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3671567,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we came together\nand we went out dancing last night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3674600,
    "dDurationMs": 1658,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, and it was good.\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3676477,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But she still, she has rage in her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3678400,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I was being beat\nwhile I was pregnant with her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3681500,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She carries this energy that sometimes\nshe will take out on me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3684800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I'm the closest one to her and I'm\nthe only one that she can just, like, release."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3689600,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was something so freaking stupid, right?\nIt was so sad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3693100,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that's what pissed me off the most,\nis like, this is so freaking stupid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3697500,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why am I arguing with a teenager about this dumb shit?\nLike, it just really pissed me off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3702300,
    "dDurationMs": 4063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're aware that you're losing the argument\njust because you're arguing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3707173,
    "dDurationMs": 2927,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, exactly. Dang it. Yeah. That's the real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3710100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do you have any perspective about, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3713100,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of course it's her own journey\nand she's still young,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3716400,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but she'll have to go through some version\nof healing and understanding herself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3721500,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and things that happened before she was born.\nWhat's your perspective on that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3726500,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, where's your mind at with that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3728900,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure how much action you could really take,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3732200,
    "dDurationMs": 2817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I guess, what are your thoughts on that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3735911,
    "dDurationMs": 4689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, what I understand now is that, you know,\nour souls choose our path, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3740600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she chose a lot of the things\nfor the evolution of her own soul."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3744600,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can only be here as a guide to help her\nthrough her process, but it is hers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3749500,
    "dDurationMs": 4805,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her journey is hers. And I had to understand that.\nI had to really, like, because..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3754777,
    "dDurationMs": 3523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Prior, I was projecting what I wanted for her onto her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3758300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not listening to her, what she wants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3761000,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she has her own inner guidance system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3763700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She has her own wisdom that she carries,\nyou know, her soul carries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3768000,
    "dDurationMs": 2302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I just have to trust and believe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3770910,
    "dDurationMs": 5090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and know that she is being guided by forces,\nby energy greater than me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3776000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my knowledge and my limited\nphysical ability to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3780000,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she's definitely wise beyond her years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3783100,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But she does have her moments where she was like\na little girl throwing a temper tantrum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3789500,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she was 18, and, like, grow up already."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3792600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I had to understand, like,\nshe's on her journey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3796200,
    "dDurationMs": 3752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and really having grace through it,\nthrough that part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3800357,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it did take a lot of time for me to see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3803000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because she started smoking weed at a young age"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3805400,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she was skipping school and just acting out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3807900,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of it was from the divorce, but I didn't know\nwhat was going on behind the scenes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3812800,
    "dDurationMs": 4769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, my ex-husband was really manipulating her.\nShe was carrying the heavy secret of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3817569,
    "dDurationMs": 3231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the betrayal, the affair,\nand just a lot of things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3820800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were happening behind the scenes\nthat I wasn't aware of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3824400,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she was trying to escape and numb herself\nand not feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3828100,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because she has, her emotions\nare her greatest gifts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3831600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, she has the ability to really feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3834200,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when she feels like she's off, she is a force\nto be reckoned with, I will say that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3839700,
    "dDurationMs": 2473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm just grateful because this girl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3842915,
    "dDurationMs": 3985,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I brought into the world is, like, pure magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3846900,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, she has so many beautiful gifts\nthat she gets to share."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3851600,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, she's an artist, and I feel like artists\ncan feel things deeper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3857200,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, beyond measure, like that.\nI can't even imagine. And so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3861967,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to change my perception of her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3864400,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, she is a beautiful, magical being\nthat I got to bring into the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3869100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I, you know, I became the vessel for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3872000,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's, like, this little fairy.\nShe's good at everything she does. She can cook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3877100,
    "dDurationMs": 4375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She can, except cleaning. She doesn't clean.\nThat's an argument, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3883078,
    "dDurationMs": 3822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paint, she can draw.\nShe's a tattoo artist at a young age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3886900,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, she discovered her passion\nand what she loves to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3890600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she's super magnetic, has a great personality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3893800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I look at these amazing qualities\nthat she has."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3897400,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, despite anything that has happened\nbefore her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3901300,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "despite, you know, her coming into this world,\nlike, she is a really great human being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3906900,
    "dDurationMs": 3414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm grateful for her.\nAnd so understanding, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3910314,
    "dDurationMs": 3729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I get to be her mom,\nthat I get to experience her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3914533,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though we have our moments, because of course\nwe're two women, we're hormonal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3919400,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, like, we're going through our own journeys"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3922300,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we don't ever see eye to eye, ever.\nBut one day we will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3925700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I mean, you know who knows how to push\nyour buttons better than anyone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3930300,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The people you love the most, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3932500,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's how it goes, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3934600,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, oh man, what a force to reckon with,\nyou know, as she gets older,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3938800,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, you know, she's now at the age where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3941178,
    "dDurationMs": 3722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you all get to have, you know,\nyou have the mother and daughter relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3944900,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure you have such a friendship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3946600,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you really get to start diving more\ninto that friendship version of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3950400,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's more of an adult on her own. She's really\ngoing to start making her own decisions and stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3955200,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, I mean, that must be a powerful friendship\ngoing forward that you guys are going to have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3960129,
    "dDurationMs": 1471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it is a powerful bond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3961600,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I stopped trying to silence her,\nbecause that was something that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3965300,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, it was too much for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3967200,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't want to hear her emotions,\nwhat she was going through or experiencing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3971500,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that stems from my own childhood\nof being silenced all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3975600,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I was projecting that onto her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3977700,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that was the thing, is allowing her to be herself,\njust accept her for who she is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3982400,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's who she is,\nand I get to experience that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3985000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's just, yeah, changing that narrative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3987400,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Yeah. Okay, beautiful thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3989300,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like to... you've mentioned\na couple of times here projection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3993100,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's probably plenty of people who have,\nthey've probably heard this, for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3997400,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anybody listening is probably, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3999500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have some version of kind of\nunderstanding what this means."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4003100,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's something we're all kind of\nexploring and learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4006500,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, you know, feeling when it's happening\nin real time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4009500,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you give me maybe not necessarily\na definition of projection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4013000,
    "dDurationMs": 2593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what do you mean when you say projection?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4016370,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely. That's a great question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4019300,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I understood and believe and know now\nabout projection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4024300,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it is when, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4026900,
    "dDurationMs": 6900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "growing up as a child, let's say my aunt,\nwho didn't go through her own healing journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4033800,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't have the tools,\ndoesn't know what that means."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4038000,
    "dDurationMs": 6281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She feels insecure, lack of self-worth,\nlack of self-love for herself, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4044602,
    "dDurationMs": 4198,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so in return, that energy of what she feels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4048800,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or those emotions of how she feels about herself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4053400,
    "dDurationMs": 2525,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are then projected onto me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4056549,
    "dDurationMs": 5051,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, for example, I'm stupid,\nor I'm whatever name she wants to call me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4061600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that is a reflection\nof how her inner world is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4065200,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's just projecting it onto anyone else,\neveryone outside of her,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4069700,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because she hasn't taken the time to do the inner work\nof, like, why do I feel this way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4075700,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I feel like I'm stupid, or do I feel...\nAnd where did this come from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4080500,
    "dDurationMs": 5648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where did this idea or this feeling or emotion\ncome from? So to me, it is somebody"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4086148,
    "dDurationMs": 3952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking how they feel,\nand it becomes a reflection in their..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4090100,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I say projection, it means that they're\nverbally saying it about somebody else,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4095200,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's not mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4096700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, and then, you know, I carry that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4099300,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I carry those ideas or thoughts or beliefs\nabout myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4102800,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and realizing, wait a second,\nthat's not even mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4106100,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm carrying somebody else's limiting beliefs\nor how they feel about themselves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4111400,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and having to really do the work of, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4114110,
    "dDurationMs": 2396,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, give that back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4117080,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not mine to carry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4119500,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And understanding, no, I am whole. I am worthy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4124000,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am the miracle because I exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4127100,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just rephrasing those ideas\nand where they came from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4132400,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like doing the affirmations, the I ams."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4136600,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am powerful. I am a creator.\nI am happy. I am whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4141800,
    "dDurationMs": 3326,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am worthy of love. I am that I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4145919,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Okay. I love the way you said that,\nbecause, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4149200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when we're reminding ourselves\nof those obvious truths,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4152000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when someone comes at us with, like,\nI'm not worthy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4154800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you go, oh, that's not true. That's not mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4157200,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Feel it in your body almost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4159000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The word intuition is coming to mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4161000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do you have, like, a way of kind of\nunderstanding now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4164000,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where, like, okay, this is my intuition\nin my thoughts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4166900,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, okay, that thing I'm feeling\nis actually your thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4170000,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, how do you separate?\nHow do you determine that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4173847,
    "dDurationMs": 3353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen to your body. Your body will tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4177200,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my gosh, our bodies are so freaking wise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4180600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, listen, pay attention to,\nhow is your gut feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4184600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your intuition lives in your solar plexus area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4188200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that is, like, your gut area,\nyour solar plexus, your sacral,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4193000,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your lower chakras, even the grounding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4196831,
    "dDurationMs": 5169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's paying attention.\nLike, what am I feeling in this moment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4202000,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does this feel heavy or does it feel lighter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4205500,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's how you can really start\ntrusting your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4209800,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can even ask, what I've learned is that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4213200,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can ask yourself or your higher self questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4217200,
    "dDurationMs": 3543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's this exercise that I started doing of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4222346,
    "dDurationMs": 6054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trusting myself, trusting my intuition,\ntrusting the guidance, our inner navigation system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4228400,
    "dDurationMs": 3615,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's understanding, okay,\nwhat is a yes? What is a no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4232657,
    "dDurationMs": 4843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does that feel like in my body?\nAnd then asking questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4237500,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I go to this event?\nAnd then feeling, waiting for the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4242800,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's a yes, go. If it's a no, don't go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4246100,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you start to receive more of that guidance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4250200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You start to pay attention to yourself more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4254400,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I eat this? Does my body want this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4258300,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And really trusting what your body says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4262000,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's a muscle test you can do,\nlike, yes, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4266900,
    "dDurationMs": 6486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can do it right now. You can do,\nyes, this is a yes, no, yes, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4274685,
    "dDurationMs": 1615,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can ask yourself things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4276300,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Muscle testing is a little,\nI'm actually interested in muscle testing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4279900,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm starting to learn about it,\nbut it's kind of new for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4283000,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you give me a brief explanation\nof what is muscle testing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4286300,
    "dDurationMs": 2425,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, muscle testing is asking your body questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4289181,
    "dDurationMs": 2819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, for example, I do Theta Healing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4292000,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Theta Healing is where we really target\nthose limiting beliefs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4296900,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we reprogram them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4298700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we find out what the limiting belief is,\nwhere it lives,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4303300,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there's four levels of beliefs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4306400,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's core, ancestral, soul, and collective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4310100,
    "dDurationMs": 6081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's four levels. We figure out\nwhere it lives and then we reprogram it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4317818,
    "dDurationMs": 5882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And muscle testing, this is one way.\nJust ask yourself, this is yes, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4323700,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every time, yes, yes is, like, solid.\nNo, it'll separate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4328600,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am worthy on all four levels.\nOh, that was a no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4332800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then I have to reprogram that limiting belief."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4336800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's something I'll have to go do\nwith myself later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4341600,
    "dDurationMs": 3538,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe I'm projecting on you from over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4345459,
    "dDurationMs": 5341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But another way you can muscle test,\nwhat I've learned through Theta Healing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4350800,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is you face north, you hydrate your body,\nand then you close your eyes and you say yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4356700,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, your body will naturally move forward.\nNo, your body will naturally move backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4362800,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's another way. It's just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4364950,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trusting your body. Your body knows.\nIt really does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4368100,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because what I believe is that your energy,\nyour auric field,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4371800,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enters a place three days before\nyou physically experience it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4375600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why we experience things\nlike deja vu sometimes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4378900,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because our energy has already been there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4381600,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why you feel things, like sometimes\nyou can feel when there's danger,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4386100,
    "dDurationMs": 1344,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you feel the fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4388035,
    "dDurationMs": 3165,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because your body has already been there.\nIt's warning you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4391200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's telling you, like, hey, this is not safe.\nIt's up to you to listen to that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4395400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But your intuition is such a powerful tool\nthat has been embedded in you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4399400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, since before you were born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4401400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's your guidance system. It's your higher self,\nyour angels, your guides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4405400,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you feel, this is kind of a weird question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4407800,
    "dDurationMs": 4383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you feel your perception of time has shifted\nsince your spiritual awakening?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4413600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, because, well,\nI know that time is an illusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4418600,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't really exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4420900,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything is perfect. It just is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4424100,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then having to accept and surrender to that,\nwhere I don't rush around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4431200,
    "dDurationMs": 4253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before, like pre-awakening, I was always late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4435892,
    "dDurationMs": 5708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was late for everything. I was always late\nto work, to my nine-to-five job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4441600,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would show up half an hour late all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4445100,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And post-awakening, time is an illusion\nthat doesn't actually exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4450200,
    "dDurationMs": 3917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But also making the best of it,\nbeing in the moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4454657,
    "dDurationMs": 4343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just understanding, like, okay,\nthis is the only moment that actually exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4459000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the only reality that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4461000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it goes even deeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4462600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, the spiritual awakening thing\nis not, like, a one and done thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4466600,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's levels to it. Yeah.\nAnd there's constant evolution and growing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4470500,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm still learning more. Like,\neverything is a learning opportunity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4474200,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Information will come to me and I'm like, oh,\nand if it resonates, it feels like it's in alignment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4479700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, hey, that's for me. Like, understanding that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4482300,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the universe is moving you in a direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4486600,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually you'll experience whatever it is in threes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4491400,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, for example, moving to Colombia was something..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4496100,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One, the energy needed to open up.\nIt'll provide the perfect time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4502200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And not having to predict or plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4505400,
    "dDurationMs": 4793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm such a go-with-the-flow type of person.\nIt can be..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4510193,
    "dDurationMs": 5707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I probably need a little bit more grounding,\nbut for me, just trusting and surrendering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4515900,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has become such a part of me, of, like, who I am.\nIt's been embedded into me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4520900,
    "dDurationMs": 6472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I just understand that I'm not really in control\nof anything, just going with the flow of life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4527928,
    "dDurationMs": 4072,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Yeah. I feel like, you know,\nbefore my own spiritual awakening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4532000,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "becoming aware of how often,\nbecause I would be late as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4535600,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just how often I'd be just trying to scream at myself\nin my head as I'm running late,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4540700,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, okay, now go faster\nand start moving faster around your house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4544700,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, those milliseconds matter, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4547200,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, what a state of stress\nto continually put yourself in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4550760,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yeah. Okay. I slept a little bit late.\nAll right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4553800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess I'm a little bit late today.\nYou know, like, it's just..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4556800,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Matthew McConaughey said this thing recently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4559300,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of keeping all these meetings and, like,\nI have to be here at this time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4563600,
    "dDurationMs": 1926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he just says, I'm just stopping by."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4566083,
    "dDurationMs": 2717,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I've been thinking about that a lot lately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4568800,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, oh, hello, kitty cat. Featured guest. Awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4571700,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he just says, I'm just stopping by."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4574000,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to me, that kind of makes me think\nof that feeling of, like, oh, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4578500,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suddenly I'll remember that or I'll notice\nthat I'm kind of rushing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4582500,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or I'm, like, you know, berating myself\nfor running behind or whatever in my head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4587400,
    "dDurationMs": 1802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you kind of notice, oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4589505,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's cool. I'll be good.\nI'll get there when I get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4592800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not the end of the world if I'm coming this late.\nWe're all going to be okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4597600,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. And a few things that I learned\nfrom the medicine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4600900,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is we are the dreamer having the dream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4603300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all an illusion. This isn't real anyways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4606000,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, we apply so much.\nAnd it's all temporary. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4610295,
    "dDurationMs": 4605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything, like, nothing is permanent.\nSo it's all, all is well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4614900,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're always being guided,\nand everything is divine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4618900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a bigger picture that we don't see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4621900,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, maybe that millisecond that you're late,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4625200,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now you have this encounter\nthat you wouldn't have had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4629100,
    "dDurationMs": 6153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, the universe is always working things out\nin such a magical, intentional way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4635574,
    "dDurationMs": 3926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, if I didn't go here at that time,\nI wouldn't have met that person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4639500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that led me on this path and took me there.\nYou know what I mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4643100,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just like everything is so perfect.\nJust understanding everything is working out for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4648348,
    "dDurationMs": 4652,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allow. Allow. Allow. Allow.\nAnd then later, allow, and keep allowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4653000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really is like that. Oh, wow. Okay.\nWell, we're getting up here in time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4658000,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like we could talk for many more hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4661100,
    "dDurationMs": 5136,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, I think there's so much cool stuff\nthat I want to talk to you about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4666236,
    "dDurationMs": 4664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's kind of round the corner here.\nWe've covered a lot of cool stuff here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4670900,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I kind of want to tie a bow on it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4672800,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then just one more time, kind of, you know,\nremind people of where to find you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4678000,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, I'll have all those links,\nanything that you say in here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4682200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything that you've sent me will be down below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4685000,
    "dDurationMs": 4186,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So everybody check that out.\nBut so let's go with this. Let's say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4690114,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if there's anything you'd like\nto leave the audience with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4692700,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, we've just been talking\nto these people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4695100,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say they're hanging on the edge of their seat.\nThis is all super interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4698800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe they're in the position\nwhere they're like you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4701200,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're on the other side of healing\nand they're constantly healing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4704300,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a constant maturation, right?\nWe don't arrive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4706600,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not an awakening and we're done.\nWe know that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4708900,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe they're on that side. But maybe there's\neven someone listening who is, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4712900,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now they're still\nin that abusive relationship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4715200,
    "dDurationMs": 2606,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or maybe their best friend\nis in that abusive relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4717806,
    "dDurationMs": 5694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody needs to hear something from before\nand after these versions of Jess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4723500,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's assume that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4724800,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what message or insight might you have for them?\nLet's start there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4729900,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. The insight and message I would have,\nbecause we seek these partners, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4735900,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because we're looking for love.\nWe're looking for acceptance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4740300,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're looking for connection and partnership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4743600,
    "dDurationMs": 4075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we accept what is given to us.\nSo I would say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4748147,
    "dDurationMs": 4053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the love that you're seeking is within you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4752200,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To take the moment to breathe, to stop,\nto ask yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4757600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who am I? Who do I want to be?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4760600,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What am I evolving to?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4762700,
    "dDurationMs": 7400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how can I become a better version of myself\nto get through these moments?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4770100,
    "dDurationMs": 1976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, breathe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4772565,
    "dDurationMs": 5335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, remember that nothing is permanent\nand that you always have a choice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4777900,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the moment you make a definite decision of,\nI am no longer going to tolerate this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4783700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will no longer stay in this.\nI will no longer be a part of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4788300,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you get to change the script and the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4791700,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the moment you make a definite decision,\nlike, no more, you back it by your emotion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4797800,
    "dDurationMs": 2035,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I will no longer do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4800679,
    "dDurationMs": 4821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The universe will move things in such a way\nto make it happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4805500,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your reality will begin to shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4808000,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When your reality begins to shift,\nbecause it will,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4811900,
    "dDurationMs": 6667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you're making a definite decision\nfor your life and you're changing the story,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4819191,
    "dDurationMs": 3209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then allow it, trust it, surrender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4822400,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you get to meet yourself, more of yourself\non the other side of that shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4829500,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And fear will come up. When it does, let it go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4833800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fear is an illusion. It is not real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4837000,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can figure out what those fears are.\nWhat am I afraid of?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4842700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Face them head on. Overcome them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4845600,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's on the other side of fear that,\nagain, you meet more of yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4852600,
    "dDurationMs": 3425,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You become a whole, complete version of..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4856464,
    "dDurationMs": 5536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you get to realize that that experience\nthat you had was information that you now have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4862000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can turn your pain into purpose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4864400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning that you can share your story,\nrelease the shame,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4868000,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the shame of the woman that stayed\nin that abusive relationship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4871700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and understand that it was part of your soul journey\nso that you can evolve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4876300,
    "dDurationMs": 3654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you now have this information\nto grow and help others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4879954,
    "dDurationMs": 1446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can be a guide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4881400,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's not allowing that\nto be your definite ending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4884600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not your story. You can always change it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4887600,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. Well said. I mean, so you discovered,\nwhen you're on your healing journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4892400,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you started listening to self-help podcasts\nand audiobooks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4895900,
    "dDurationMs": 4523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you found, like, Lewis Howes,\nThe School of Greatness, and all this stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4900913,
    "dDurationMs": 3487,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, look at this prime example.\nYou're on a podcast right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4904400,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, like, you know, the people who helped you,\nyou're now helping people on a podcast, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4909500,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And someone listening, maybe they could never\npicture themselves in that position,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4913800,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but whatever their intuition is telling them\nthat they're capable of doing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4917600,
    "dDurationMs": 2095,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, it's like, if you can dream it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4920252,
    "dDurationMs": 4648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, maybe it could really happen.\nI really think, you know, it's like, yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4924900,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have stories on that, too. Yeah.\nSo, yeah, we need a couple more hours, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4929300,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, our interests are not random. I like to say that.\nI think that that is very true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4933900,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you know, whatever is popping into your mind\nas a listener right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4937900,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or whatever, it's like, man,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4939388,
    "dDurationMs": 3912,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "man, I kind of want to step away from this\nand start doing this, or, you know, whatever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4943300,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if that's your experience right now as a listener.\nNot everybody's having that thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4947100,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a reason why you're having that thought."
